<title>USA: Chris-Craft Industries Q3 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Chris-Craft Industries Q3 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>				    Third Quarter	Nine Months</p>
<p>				 1996     1995	  1996	1995</p>
<p> Operating revenues $ 111,777 $ 115,584   $ 342,927 $ 349,527</p>
