<p>(a)  UPN is currently 100 percent owned by BHC Communications Inc, Chris-Craft's television broadcasting subsidiary. Viacom Inc's Paramount Television Group has an option to acquire an interest in UPN equal to that of BHC, and BHC accounts for its interest in UPN under the equity method.</p>
<p>(b)  After state income tax reversal of $20 million.</p>
<p>(c)  Reflects the interest of stockholders other than Chris-Craft in the operating results of  BHC, 76 percent owned at September 30, 1996, and the interest of stockholders other than BHC in the operating results of United Television Inc, 58 percent owned by BHC at September 30, 1996.  </p>
<p>(d)  Before preferred stock dividend requirements of $100 and $115 in the third quarters and $329 and $349 in the nine month periods of 1996 and 1995, respectively. (e)  After giving effect to the April 1996 3 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Chris-Craft Industries Inc</p>
